+bash scripts/run_unidr_experiment.sh /absolute/new/formal /absolute/new/report /absolute/new/holdout single
+```
+
+Use `four` for the implemented four-GPU mapping (Sim 0, Gym 1, Genesis 2, Motrix CPU,
